.DS_Store
.env

odoo-db-dump/
data/
logs/
certs/

*.tgz
*.zip
*.gz

# moved-aside PG14 datadirs from the PG15 bump (Module 28)
data/postgresql.pg14*

# generated sink connectors carry an injected password - regenerate with scripts/generate-local-sink-connectors.sh
debezium/local/connectors/generated/

# Same rule, CLOUD side (F-010). generate-sink-connectors.sh writes
# mysql-sink-<table>.json straight into debezium/cloud/connectors/ - NOT into a
# generated/ subdir - with connection.password already substituted. On the mini
# that is 19 files carrying the live sink DB password, in a tracked directory,
# in a repo whose origin is public. A single `git add -A` there publishes them.
# The *.json.template and known-good.json files do NOT match this pattern.
debezium/cloud/connectors/mysql-sink-*.json
debezium/cloud/connectors/generated/

# The bahmni-config service's entrypoint REWRITES whatever tree is mounted at
# /usr/local/bahmni_config. docker-compose.override.yml points it here so it can
# never touch bahmni_config/ again - so this tree is churn the service owns,
# regenerated on every boot, and must never be committed.
.local-config-scratch/

# scripting jars for the Filter SMT: fetch with config/kafka-connect/ext/fetch-scripting-jars.sh
config/kafka-connect/ext/*.jar
*.pyc

# --- Rendered MirrorMaker config (2026-09-14) --------------------------------
# scripts/setup-mirrormaker.sh renders these from the .template files beside
# them. They are per-node OUTPUT and must never be committed: both copies were
# tracked until today carrying a real remote broker host and this node's
# consumer group id, so a fresh clinic cloned another node's identity, and two
# clinics sharing one MirrorMaker consumer group id split the partitions
# between them and each sees only half its own changes.
#
# ORDERING: config/mirrormaker/mm2.properties is BIND-MOUNTED by
# docker-compose.yml:453. Docker creates a DIRECTORY at a bind-mount source
# that does not exist, so `setup-mirrormaker.sh` must run BEFORE the first
# `docker compose up` on a new node -- otherwise MirrorMaker starts against an
# empty directory. (That failure is what the old install-clinic.sh warning was
# describing when it called this path "an empty DIRECTORY in the tree".)
# ONLY the legacy path is ignored today. config/mirrormaker/mm2.properties is
# still TRACKED on purpose: setup-mirrormaker.sh CANNOT regenerate it. A render
# into a scratch tree on 2026-09-14 differed from the live file in 54 lines --
# it drops the .all aggregate topics (ADR-004) and every Odoo/OpenELIS topic in
# both directions, the BL-029 producer tuning (delivery.timeout.ms=7200000,
# linger/batch/zstd), and the whole down-direction source.producer block. The
# committed file is the ONLY copy of that tuning, so ignoring it would delete
# it from every fresh clone. Fix the template, prove render == live byte for
# byte, THEN add the second line back.
debezium/local/mirrormaker-config/mm2.properties
